  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sitting down after those failed doorbell calls, Ono suddenly praises Muranishi for supporting his wife, two children, and mother all by himself. The moment Muranishi brightens up, Ono grins—he was demonstrating the secret of sales talk. Listen to Ono's lesson.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "まあ、でもお前は頑張ってるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "嫁さんと子供二人とおふくろさんを食べさせてるんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "立派だよ、本当に。根性もあるしな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "一瞬やる気になったろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "これがセールストークの基本だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "褒めて相手を口説くんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "褒めて、褒めて、心を開かせろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "なるべく丁寧な言葉でな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "英語の教材を売ってるんだから英語を使え。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お恥ずかしながら、私、イングリッシュは苦手で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "難しく考えるな。何でもいいから単語を言えばいいんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "まあ、でもお前は頑張ってるよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, still, you are working really hard.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "嫁さんと子供二人とおふくろさんを食べさせてるんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are feeding your wife, two kids, and your mum, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "立派だよ、本当に。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is admirable, truly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "一瞬やる気になったろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For a second there, you felt motivated, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "これがセールストークの基本だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the foundation of sales talk.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "褒めて相手を口説くんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You praise the other person and win them over.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "褒めて、褒めて、心を開かせろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Praise them, praise them, and make them open their heart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "なるべく丁寧な言葉でな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Using as formal language as possible, mind you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お恥ずかしながら、私、イングリッシュは苦手で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Embarrassing as it is, English is my weak point.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "難しく考えるな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not overthink it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ono",
      "t": "何でもいいから単語を言えばいいんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just say any single words at all.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
